(4, 'Dr. James Anderson', 'Anxiety & CBT Treatment', 'james.anderson@example.com', 'Dedicated to designing customized, goal-oriented CBT plans to assist clients in overcoming phobias, general anxiety, and academic stress.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537368910025-700350fe46c7?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=300', 4),
